WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.500
Move the arm from the bottom center toward the blue box on the left side of the table.

2
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:03.000
Descend and close the gripper to grasp the blue box.

3
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:05.500
Lift the blue box and transport it to the right toward the basket.

4
00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:07.000
Lower the blue box into the basket and open the gripper to release it.

5
00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:08.500
Retract the arm and move left to approach the orange box.

6
00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:10.000
Descend and close the gripper to grasp the orange box.

7
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:11.500
Lift the orange box and transport it to the right toward the basket.

8
00:00:11.500 --> 00:00:12.500
Lower the orange box into the basket and open the gripper to release it.

